sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Caller
    participant M as FeedbackManager
    participant P as Lifecycle policy
    participant S as FeedbackStore

    C->>M: cancel(feedback_id)
    loop until applied, or nothing left to do
        M->>S: get(feedback_id)
        S-->>M: current event (status X)
        alt X is already CANCELLED
            M-->>C: current event, nothing published
        else X to CANCELLED is illegal
            M-->>C: FeedbackLifecycleError
        else legal
            M->>P: authorize_transition(current, CANCELLED)
            M->>S: transition(CANCELLED, expected=X)
            alt status is still X
                S-->>M: updated event
                M-->>C: updated event, published once
            else changed concurrently
                S-->>M: FeedbackConflictError
                Note over M: retry with the fresh status
            end
        end
    end
